{
  "description": "Which documented method tables (method_tables in blizzard_api.json) make up each WoW object type, and the types it inherits every method of. The documentation doesn't say this, so it's maintained by hand; every entry was reviewed. Types not listed have no known methods, and calls on them aren't checked for missing methods.",
  "types": {
    "ScriptObject": {"base": "table", "method_tables": ["SimpleObjectAPI"]},
    "FrameScriptObject": {"base": "table", "inherits": ["ScriptObject"], "method_tables": ["SimpleFrameScriptObjectAPI"]},
